# TEMPLATE CONFIGURATION

> **Phase 0 Reference** — Template-First / Per-Phase Write Contract (Pattern #20 v2)
> **Loaded by**: Phase 0 of `@01_Phase_Orchestration.mdc` to create the deliverable skeleton

