## TEMPLATE LOCATION

```
r-genie/Salesforce_Solution_Architect_Agent/
├── templates/
│   ├── solution-architecture-style.yaml      ← This file's structure source
│   └── solution-architecture-template-guide.md ← Section-by-section content guide
├── examples/
│   └── 01_fnol_insurance_guidewire/
│       └── solution_architecture_fnol_guidewire.md  ← CANONICAL ANCHOR
└── rules/
    └── 00_Template_Configuration.mdc         ← THIS FILE
```

**Verbosity benchmark**: Always benchmark output length and structure against `examples/01_fnol_insurance_guidewire/solution_architecture_fnol_guidewire.md`. NOT against hard line caps. See `@02_Guidance.mdc` Example-Anchored Conciseness section.

