## PRE-GENERATION CHECKLIST (MANDATORY)

Before generating ANY content (must complete in Phase 0 BEFORE skeleton creation):

- [ ] `templates/solution-architecture-style.yaml` read in full
- [ ] `templates/solution-architecture-template-guide.md` read in full
- [ ] `examples/01_fnol_insurance_guidewire/` example reviewed (verbosity anchor)
- [ ] All 12 sections identified and confirmed against template
- [ ] Section markers (`<!-- SECTION: ... -->`) prepared for skeleton
- [ ] Output filename slug derived from scenario (e.g., `fnol-insurance-guidewire`)
- [ ] Skeleton write path confirmed: `project/output_salesforce_solution_architect/{scenario-slug}-solution-architecture.md`

**If ANY check fails → DO NOT PROCEED → Fix first.** Skipping the checklist breaks Pattern #20 v2 — later phases will have no markers to `edit` into and will fall back to chat accumulation (Anti-Pattern, see `@03_Mandatory_Stop_Points.mdc`).

