## FILENAME SLUG RULES

The agent derives `{scenario-slug}` from the scenario in Phase 0:
- Lowercase, hyphen-separated
- Includes domain + integration partner: `fnol-insurance-guidewire`, `loyalty-mulesoft-sap`, `service-cloud-genesys`
- Max 50 chars; if longer, truncate at last hyphen before 50

Examples:
- "FNOL on Salesforce Insurance Cloud + Guidewire" → `fnol-insurance-guidewire`
- "Service Cloud → SAP CDC integration" → `service-cloud-sap-cdc`
- "Loyalty + MuleSoft + Marketing Cloud" → `loyalty-mulesoft-marketing-cloud`

